sagittarius-scheme
------------------------------------------
Free Scheme implementation supporting R6RS and R7RS

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libatomic1-14.4.0-1
  libffi8-3.8.0-1
  libgc1-8.2.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libiodbc2-3.52.8-2
  libsagittarius-devel-0.9.15-1bl1
  libsagittarius0.9.15-0.9.15-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libffi-devel-3.8.0-1
  libgc-devel-8.2.12-1
  libiodbc-devel-3.52.8-2
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ktakashi/sagittarius-scheme

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ktakashi/sagittarius-scheme/releases/download/v0.9.15/sagittarius-0.9.15.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack sagittarius-scheme-0.9.15-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./sagittarius-scheme-0.9.15-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/sagittarius-scheme-0.9.15-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/sagittarius-scheme-0.9.15-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsagittarius0.9.15-0.9.15-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsagittarius-devel-0.9.15-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

